#X text 20 20 CPU guard: Pd's load = CPU time / logical time \, each second. Above 78 % the piece gets lighter (1: cloud and atmosphere off \, 2: textures and pad character off \, 3: auto-vocoder off) \; below 50 % for 20 s it steps back. SETUP page 4 can turn the guard off. In a batch (offline) run the load reads near 0. acloadtest overrides it for tests.;
