#X text 20 20 The Organelle keys are functions: low octave = knob pages \, harmony and form (aux + key = that SETUP page) \, top octave = layers \, input \, Freeze \, transport. Hold Root (low G) and play a key or MIDI note \, or turn knob 1: the next key. Aux tap: next page. Footswitch: change now.;
#X obj 20 44 r notesRaw;
#X obj 20 68 unpack f f;
#X obj 20 92 v ackv;
#X obj 20 116 t b f;
#X obj 20 140 v ackn;
#X obj 20 164 t b b;
#X obj 20 188 s ac-hintstop;
#X obj 20 212 expr ackv > 0;
#X obj 20 236 sel 0;
#X obj 20 260 b;
